description = "Several characters per player (Phase 226). The player is the account that connects; a character is who walks the world. A player keeps up to 4 characters on a server, picked from a list after choosing a world or joining a server. A new character starts from scratch: no items, base attributes, no skills, research, books or clan, and nothing from the player's other characters. Names are unique on the server across every character. Deleting a character asks for its name typed out; its structures go to its clan, or become ownerless when it had none. The character owns: body, name, hp, position, statusEffects, attributes, attributeGrowth, inventory, equipment, skills, skillXp, skillFocus, professions, titles, cooldowns, craftCounter, research, booksLearned, tamingFlags, companions, waystones, clanMembership, ownedStructures, spawnBed. The player owns: friendCode, settings, admin, lastCharacter."
tags = ["world-system"]
